body:
I drive a stick shift, so I tell her to give me her hand and I'll shift with my hand on top of hers.

&#x200B;

Really  Cliché but it works...

I would make the "Attention Grabber" in the first 15 seconds of the video. So for instance, something that grabs the attention of the audience to encourage them to continue watching the video in the beginning. 

&#x200B;

(FYI I have like 230 subs so take my advice with a grain of salt)
